; Строки страниц языков интерфейса и языковых моделей (models.nsh). Файл в UTF-8 с BOM — иначе NSIS
; прочитает его в кодировке системы. $R0 — имя модели, $R7 — скачано МБ, $R4 — всего МБ.

!insertmacro REEVER_LANG ENGLISH reeverUiTitle "Interface languages"
!insertmacro REEVER_LANG ENGLISH reeverUiSubtitle "Choose the languages Reever's interface can use."
!insertmacro REEVER_LANG ENGLISH reeverUiNote "English is always included. Translations are built in: you can add or remove languages later in Settings → Interface."
!insertmacro REEVER_LANG ENGLISH reeverNeedPack "Choose at least one language pack: European languages or Chinese, Japanese, Korean. Reever needs one to recognise speech."
!insertmacro REEVER_LANG ENGLISH reeverModelsTitle "Language models"
!insertmacro REEVER_LANG ENGLISH reeverModelsSubtitle "English is always installed. Choose at least one language pack."
!insertmacro REEVER_LANG ENGLISH reeverEuropean "European languages: Parakeet v3, 465 MB download"
!insertmacro REEVER_LANG ENGLISH reeverEuropeanInfo "Russian, German, French, Spanish, Italian, Portuguese and 18 more. Also understands English words mixed into speech."
!insertmacro REEVER_LANG ENGLISH reeverAsian "Chinese, Japanese, Korean: SenseVoice, 155 MB download"
!insertmacro REEVER_LANG ENGLISH reeverAsianInfo "Voice commands and dictation in Chinese and Japanese."
!insertmacro REEVER_LANG ENGLISH reeverLid "Language detector: Whisper base, 198 MB download (recommended)"
!insertmacro REEVER_LANG ENGLISH reeverLidInfo "Needed to use both language packs at the same time: it decides which model hears each phrase."
!insertmacro REEVER_LANG ENGLISH reeverInstalled "(already downloaded)"
!insertmacro REEVER_LANG ENGLISH reeverModelsNote "Models are saved to %LOCALAPPDATA%\com.troid.reever\models and are not downloaded again when Reever updates. To add a pack later, run this installer again."
!insertmacro REEVER_LANG ENGLISH reeverDownloadStart "Downloading $R0 ($R4 MB)..."
!insertmacro REEVER_LANG ENGLISH reeverDownloading "Downloading $R0: $R7 of $R4 MB"
!insertmacro REEVER_LANG ENGLISH reeverVerifying "Checking $R0..."
!insertmacro REEVER_LANG ENGLISH reeverExtracting "Unpacking $R0..."
!insertmacro REEVER_LANG ENGLISH reeverModelReady "$R0 is ready."
!insertmacro REEVER_LANG ENGLISH reeverModelFailed "Could not download $R0."
!insertmacro REEVER_LANG ENGLISH reeverModelsFailedBox "Reever is installed, but some models could not be downloaded. Check your internet connection and run the installer again: it will resume the download."

